    "body": "You need to work on presenting your claims more clearly as this is not actionable as-is. It seems likely that certain scenarios are not optimized and it also seems plausible that a native implementation can beat a non-optimized C++ implementation, but having read this issue a few times it's not clear what specific scenarios are problematic and what benchmarks proof the claims that are made.\n\nAn alternative route you could pursue is to make this API part of an existing benchmark, forcing implementations to optimize it.",
